.SH NAME
md__scratch1_NCEPDEV_nems_Denise.Worthen_WORK_utils_dw_sorc_regrid_sfc.fd_docs_README \- README 
This program is used to regrid masked sfc fields using masked bi-linear interpolaton\&. It is designed for regridding of increments and states, and can regrid from/to the FV3 grid that the GFS model runs on, and the Gaussian grid used for GFS model output (i\&.e\&., history files)\&.
.PP
Documentation may be found at https://ufs-community.github.io/UFS_UTILS 
